==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Tackey]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bun Bun Black]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Tackey]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
**3 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**5 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You can stack [[Bombercat]] on the initial Shadow Boxer K, then spam meatshields, [[Courier Cat]] and any anti-Dark Ubers you brought to sweep this stage.

